TY  - JOUR
ID  - arxiv-1105.1998v3
AU  - (2011), SIGMA 7
AU  - 115
AU  - pages, 11
TI  - A Connection Formula of the Hahn-Exton q-Bessel Function
DA  - D:20181028
DO  - 10.3842/SIGMA.2011.115
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/1105.1998
AB  - We show a connection formula of the Hahn–Exton q-Bessel function around the origin and the infinity. We introduce the q-Borel transformation and the q-Laplace transformation following C. Zhang to obtain the connection formula. We consider the limit p →1−of the connection formula.
